      "text": "status: approved   # by the operator, 2026-11-18, in a session: \"4: yes stabilize\", in answer to the item \"three timing-sensitive tests keep reddening PRs; stabilize them in a small spec of their own\". The text below was written after that answer, from the code and the CI logs; the operator has not read it. It names two more tests than the three the operator was told about (section 3, T4 and the listed L1 to L3); T4 is built only because its cause is shown from code, and the operator may strike it. It takes effect when the operator merges the pull request that carries it."
