    },
    "text": "Tests that fail on a pull request they have nothing to do with, and pass on a rerun, cost a macOS job each time and teach people to rerun instead of read. Over 2026-11-16 to 2026-11-18 tests of this kind reddened pull requests or `main` again and again. This spec fixes the four whose cause is shown (T1 to T4), and lists the rest (L1 to L3)."
  }
